<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\チャイム.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\小学校教室.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Ow, ow, ow, ow... Good morning, everyone. 
{PAUSE ""}
How was Golden Week? I went picking mountain vegetables with my husband, and now my whole body is sore. 
{PAUSE ""}
Ugh, I really don't want to get old. Sore muscles from just that much... 
{PAUSE ""}
You're all still in elementary school, so you probably wouldn't understand."
{STOPSND "VOICE" "10000" "PASS"}
<PG>
"Now then, I have some good news today. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's sudden, but a transfer student is joining this class."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―A transfer student?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―We're getting another classmate?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Who is it, who is it!<PG>
"All right, <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-san</STYLE>, please come in."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sliding_wooden_door_C.ogg" "VOICE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE2" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
―<STYLE ID="1">Niimura</STYLE>...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Huh? I know <STYLE ID="1">this girl</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Could it be...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Um... I'm Haruka Niimura. I've come back to Motoki-cho after 2 years."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Oh! I knew it, it's <STYLE ID="1">Haruka Niimura-san</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―I remember! We were in the same class at nursery school!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Your hair used to be longer, right?<PG>
"Okay, okay, quiet down. <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-san</STYLE> has come back to Motoki-cho for family reasons. 
{PAUSE ""}
Everyone, please be nice to her."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Okaaay!<BR>
―Okaaay!<BR>
―Okaaay!<BR>
―Okaaay!<BR>
―Okaaay!<PG>
―<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-san</STYLE>, this seat's free, over here!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Hurry, hurry, come on, come on!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"O... okay..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Do you remember me!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―You moved away right after, the year before last, right?<PG>
"Ow, ow, ow... I can't lift my arms... 
{PAUSE ""}
Well, it's good she seems able to <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="なじ">fit in</STYLE>."
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
